<title>USA: BancorpSouth to trade on NYSE.</title>
<headline>BancorpSouth to trade on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancorpSouth Inc said Thursday its common stock has been listed on the New York Stock Exchange, trading under the symbol BXS.N.</p>
<p>BancorpSouth had been traded on Nasdaq.</p>
<p>The company said it operates the Bank of Mississippi and Volunteer Bank in Tennessee; in June, the two banks will be merged under the name BancorpSouth Bank and the former names will continue to be used for local identity.</p>
</text>
